      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# H3 Open Regen (standard): draft video -> 2K\n\nPorted from rdh9616/ComfyUI-Open-H3-Regenerate (Apache-2.0) onto the MiniMax H3 Suite's own nodes (core 0.39).\n\n1. **Load Video**: your draft (any fps; it is resampled to 24 fps). **Prepare Draft** cuts it to 121 frames (5 s), scales it to 768p and pads it to 124 frames (17k+5).\n2. **Refine prompt**: write a plain text prompt (H3 sections integrated_multimodal_description / overall_soundscape / non_diegetic_music). H3 Prompt Writer or H3 Vision can write one; upstream's Video-to-Prompt server node is not ported.\n3. **Run**. The refined latent is saved to `output/open_h3_latents/` before decoding (use the decode-saved-latent workflow if the decode fails), decoded with the fast H3 VAE (the H3 video VAE is the fallback) and saved with the draft's soundtrack.\n\nModels (file names only; every source UNVERIFIED; nothing is downloaded, no weights are shipped): `minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot` (diffusion_models), `open_h3_regenerate_2k_lora` and `sharp_curve_branches` (loras), `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot` (diffusion_models, curve table only), `minimax_h3_latent_upscaler_3d_conv_v1_bf16` (latent_upscale_models, .safetensors), `fast_h3_vae_noncausal_24l` (vae), the H3 text encoder and the H3 video / audio VAEs.\n\nSettings: 3 Euler steps from sigma 0.8 (Open Regen Sigmas; 0 = NVIDIA's 0.909375 release grid), CFG 1, fixed seed. 1080p / 4K: change *resolution* on Latent Upscale (4K runs two passes). The source must start at t = 0 for the soundtrack to line up. Upstream quality claims are not verified here."
      ],
      "color": "#2a2a2a",
      "bgcolor": "#353535"
    },
